## Interface: 16001
## Title: Azeroth Atlas
## Notes: Map window and questing companion (tracker, quest pins, routing arrow), built by porting Carbonite's real code.
## Author: Digital Alchemyst
## Version: 0.1.0-dev
## SavedVariables: AzerothAtlasDB
## DefaultState: Enabled
# Gathering-node field (step 9e, MinimapEngine.lua). Static Wowhead
# data (Map/Data/Gather{Herb,Mining,Fish,Treasure}.lua), no runtime
# dependency on GatherMate2 or Carbonite at all. A prior design read
# GatherMate2's own live database directly instead, but that triggered
# a recurring Blizzard "blocked from an action only available to the
# Blizzard UI" taint popup that 8+ rounds of fixes - including removing
# this addon's entire live-Blizzard-widget-blend mechanism on strong
# evidence it was the cause - never resolved; isolating tests even
# showed the popup surviving with every GatherMate2-touching call in
# this addon stubbed out, while disabling this addon entirely fixed it.
# Reverted to static data on that basis - see MinimapEngine.lua's own
# header comment on this section for the full history.

# Phase 3: window chrome. Locales/Util must load before UI (Window.lua
# reads locale strings and Util helpers at file scope); UI before Map/
# Settings so MinimapWindow:Open() and the Settings window have the
# ported Nx.Window / AzerothAtlas.UI.Window chrome to build on.

Libs\libs.xml

Core\Core.xml
Compat\Compat.xml
Locales\Locales.xml
Util\Util.xml
UI\UI.xml
Map\Map.xml
# Questing companion (tracker window, quest map pins, routing arrow).
# After Map: it places everything through the map engine's world
# coordinates. Before Settings only by convention - the Settings
# window reaches it at click time, not at load.
Quest\Quest.xml
Settings\Settings.xml
